[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Bluetooth Sync
GenericName=Bluetooth Pairing Sync
GenericName[de]=Bluetooth-Kopplungen synchronisieren
GenericName[es]=Sincronizar emparejamientos Bluetooth
GenericName[fr]=Synchronisation des appairages Bluetooth
GenericName[it]=Sincronizzazione pairing Bluetooth
GenericName[ja]=Bluetooth ペアリング同期
GenericName[pt_BR]=Sincronizar pareamentos Bluetooth
GenericName[ru]=Синхронизация сопряжений Bluetooth
GenericName[zh_CN]=蓝牙配对同步
Comment=Sync Bluetooth pairing keys between Linux and Windows (dual boot)
Comment[de]=Bluetooth-Kopplungsschlüssel zwischen Linux und Windows synchronisieren (Dualboot)
Comment[es]=Sincroniza las claves de emparejamiento Bluetooth entre Linux y Windows (arranque dual)
Comment[fr]=Synchronise les clés d'appairage Bluetooth entre Linux et Windows (double démarrage)
Comment[it]=Sincronizza le chiavi di pairing Bluetooth tra Linux e Windows (dual boot)
Comment[ja]=Linux と Windows の間で Bluetooth のペアリングキーを同期 (デュアルブート)
Comment[pt_BR]=Sincroniza as chaves de pareamento Bluetooth entre Linux e Windows (dual boot)
Comment[ru]=Синхронизация ключей сопряжения Bluetooth между Linux и Windows (двойная загрузка)
Comment[zh_CN]=在 Linux 和 Windows 之间同步蓝牙配对密钥（双系统）
Exec=bt-sync-gui
Icon=bt-sync
Categories=Settings;HardwareSettings;
Keywords=bluetooth;dualboot;windows;pairing;keys;
Terminal=false
